@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam ArrowColor black
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBorderColor transparent
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 ActivationBorderColor black
 ActivationBackgroundColor white
}
participant "<img:business-worker.png>\n收费人员" as C
participant "<img:business-worker.png>\n前台" as F
participant "<img:business-worker.png>\n诊疗助理" as A
participant "<img:business-worker.png>\n诊所负责人" as M
participant "<img:business-entity.png>\n牙科诊所管理系统" as S
C -> S : 查询指定营业日期的应收、付款\n退款、预付及供货支出
S --> C : 返回分类明细及汇总
C -> C : 与现金及各渠道实际款项核对
C -> S : 登记核对结果和差异依据
F -> S : 核对未到诊、改约及待联系事项
A -> S : 核对库存及器械处理异常
M -> S : 查看经营及未完成事项
S --> M : 返回明细来源、差异及待办
activate M
alt 差异已查明
 M -> C : 确认必要的更正或后续处理
 C -> S : 保存更正依据并关联原记录
else 需要跨日处理
 M -> S : 记录来源、责任人及期限
end
M -> S : 确认当日核对结果
S --> M : 返回结果并保留待跟进事项
deactivate M
@enduml
